# Project Context

- Build a corporate information website, not ecommerce and not a simple landing page.
- Optimize for corporate credibility, clear information architecture, brand depth, scalability, mobile UX, performance, SEO, and accessibility.
- Use `.cursor/specs/corporate-website.spec.md` as the compact source of truth.
- Read `.cursor/tasks/current-task.md` for active work.
- Open `.cursor/tasks/implementation-plan.md` only when the active task needs missing detail or after approval to load the next task.
- Do not reread the legacy Word plan unless the spec lacks information needed for the active task.
- Never invent company facts, dates, revenue, employee counts, project counts, subsidiaries, certifications, or performance claims.
- Use `[PLACEHOLDER]` for missing business data and keep it out of production releases.
- Follow the recommended direction named Corporate Systems Premium.
- Keep changes limited to the active task. Do not implement future tasks early.
